 "nl": [
  "Hosts in research may reach hr over IMAP (TCP 143) and SSH (TCP 22) and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "No packet from research may enter cameras, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow nvr to connect to dev-lab using SMTP (TCP 25) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in finance may reach library over IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Allow monitoring to connect to vpn-users using SSH (TCP 22).",
  "hr must accept IMAP (TCP 143) from vpn-users.",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) and DNS over UDP 53 on database reachable from all internal zones.",
  "edge-cache must accept IMAP (TCP 143) and LDAP (TCP 389) and RTSP (TCP 554) from cameras.",
  "No packet from printers may enter mail, even for services open to everyone.",
  "nvr is isolated: it may only reach admin on syslog (UDP 514); finance on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "database must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SSH (TCP 22) and MySQL (TCP 3306) from printers.",
  "Allow monitoring to connect to database using SSH (TCP 22) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Permit any UDP port from admin to monitoring but deny SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Any zone may connect to database over DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Apart from cameras on HTTPS (TCP 443), all traffic originating in finance must be dropped.",
  "Permit any UDP port from nvr to vpn-users but deny SNMP (UDP 161), TFTP (UDP 69)."
 ],
